      "apiDescription": "## Models\n\nTwo-way bindings. Bind each one with the `v-model` syntax shown next to it — do not pass the prop and listen to its `update:` event separately.\n\n```\nexport type GAttachFileModels = {\n  /** @default [] */\n  modelValue?: File[]; // v-model=\"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n```\nexport type GAttachFileProps = {\n  /** @default 'default' */\n  type?: \"default\" | \"drag-drop\";\n  /** @default ATTACH_FILE_MODES.UPLOAD */\n  mode?: AttachFileMode;\n  /** @default undefined */\n  inputId?: string;\n  /** @default [] */\n  acceptExtNames?: string[];\n  /** @default '10MB' */\n  maxSize?: string;\n  /** @default true */\n  multiple?: boolean;\n  /** @default undefined */\n  maxFiles?: number;\n  /** @default false */\n  disabled?: boolean;\n  /** @default true */\n  validateEvent?: boolean;\n  /** @default '' */\n  uploadButtonText?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  title?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  uploadText?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  restrictionText?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  infoText?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  downloadUrl?: string;\n  /** @default '' */\n  downloadLinkText?: string;\n  /** @default false */\n  uploading?: boolean;\n  /** @default false */\n  uploadError?: string | boolean;\n  /** @default {} */\n  fileErrors?: Record<number, string>;\n  /** @default {} */\n  fileProgress?: Record<number, number>;\n  /** @default [] */\n  errors?: string[];\n  /** @default true */\n  showFileSize?: boolean;\n  /** @default true */\n  showRemoveButton?: boolean;\n  /** @default true */\n  showUploadButton?: boolean;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GAttachFileEvents = {\n  \"update:modelValue\": [files: File[]];\n  change: [files: File[]];\n  error: [errors: string[]];\n  \"validation-error\": [errors: ValidationError[]];\n  onRetry: [];\n  download: [];\n  clearProgress: [];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type GAttachFileSlots = {\n  \"extra-content\": {};\n}\n```\n\n## Exposed\n\nAvailable on the component instance through a template ref.\n\n```\nexport type GAttachFileExposed = {\n  addFiles: (newFiles: File[]) => void;\n  openFilePicker: () => void;\n}\n```",
      "renderer": "vue3"
    }
